          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most buyers, the Anker SOLIX C300 is the power bank with an outlet to get: enough AC power for the things people actually plug into a battery, excellent USB-C and a LiFePO4 pack that will still be healthy years from now. Choose the EcoFlow River 3 if keeping the internet up through outages is the main job, and the mophie powerstation pro AC only if it has to fly or ride in a laptop bag.
          </p>
